    <string name="gestures_accessibility_status_on">Accessibility service is on</string>
    <string name="gestures_access_info">Lock screen and Recent apps need Chikku\'s optional accessibility service. It can\'t read screen content.</string>
    <string name="gestures_access_info_details">You turn the service on in system settings, and it only performs those actions. Recent apps opened this way show the system overview without the stock gesture-navigation animation; a normal launcher cannot provide that. Showing notifications and quick settings uses a status bar request available to launchers; where a device blocks it, Chikku falls back to the accessibility service.</string>
